  "decision_conditions": [
    "The submitted drawings are incomplete and inconsistent regarding the number, position and appearance of the proposed rooflights. In the absence of complete floor plans, roof plans and elevations, the applicant has failed to demonstrate that the development would preserve the character and appearance of the property and surrounding roofscape or safeguard neighbouring privacy. The proposal is therefore contrary to Policies 53 and 57 of the Waltham Forest Local Plan Part 1 (2024) and the Residential Alterations and Retrofit SPD (2026)."
